{"title":"Career Roadmap · Film Critic","role":"Film Critic","summary":"A Film Critic analyzes films and communicates an informed evaluation of their artistic, technical, cultural, narrative and social dimensions. The role combines film studies, journalism, critical writing, visual analysis and media communication.","facts":{"Current degree":"BJMC / B.A. Journalism & Mass Communication","Course":"Film Studies / Cinema Journalism"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Film Critic analyzes films and communicates an informed evaluation of their artistic, technical, cultural, narrative and social dimensions. The role combines film studies, journalism, critical writing, visual analysis and media communication."},{"type":"p","text":"A professional film critic does more than say whether a movie is “good” or “bad.” They explain how and why a film works or fails, examining elements such as direction, screenplay, acting, cinematography, editing, sound, production design, themes, genre, representation and cultural context."},{"type":"p","text":"Film critics may work for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Newspapers"},{"text":"Magazines"},{"text":"Digital publications"},{"text":"Entertainment websites"},{"text":"Film journals"},{"text":"OTT/media platforms"},{"text":"Independent media channels"},{"text":"YouTube channels"},{"text":"Podcasts"},{"text":"News organizations"},{"text":"Freelance publications"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The modern film critic increasingly operates across multiple formats:"},{"type":"p","text":"Written Review"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Video Review"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Podcast"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Social Media Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Festival Coverage"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"flow","items":["Long-form Film Essay","Multi-platform Film Critic"]}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Class 12","BJMC / B.A. Journalism & Mass Communication","Film Studies / Cinema Journalism","Film Analysis + Journalism Training","College Film Reviews / Blog / Portfolio","Media Internship","Entertainment / Film Publication","Junior Film Writer / Reviewer","Film Critic","Senior Film Critic / Film Journalist","Film Editor / Culture Editor / Columnist","Film Scholar / Media Personality / Independent Critic"]},{"type":"p","text":"An independent pathway is also possible:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Journalism Degree","Film Knowledge","YouTube / Blog / Podcast","Audience Building","Independent Film Critic","Media Brand / Creator"]}]},{"heading":"What You Learn During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Journalism & Film Foundations"},{"type":"h","text":"Journalism"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"News writing"},{"text":"Feature writing"},{"text":"Media communication"},{"text":"Reporting"},{"text":"Editing"},{"text":"Media ethics"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Interviewing"},{"text":"Digital journalism"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Film Foundations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"History of cinema"},{"text":"Indian cinema"},{"text":"World cinema"},{"text":"Film genres"},{"text":"Film language"},{"text":"Basic film theory"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Students should start watching films analytically rather than purely for entertainment."},{"type":"p","text":"Instead of:"},{"type":"p","text":"“I liked the movie.”"},{"type":"p","text":"learn to ask:"},{"type":"p","text":"“What directorial, narrative, visual and emotional choices produced that response?”"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Film Analysis & Critical Writing"},{"type":"p","text":"The second stage should develop analytical depth."},{"type":"h","text":"Film Elements"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Direction"},{"text":"Screenplay"},{"text":"Narrative structure"},{"text":"Character development"},{"text":"Acting"},{"text":"Cinematography"},{"text":"Editing"},{"text":"Sound design"},{"text":"Music"},{"text":"Production design"},{"text":"Costume"},{"text":"Visual effects"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Film Language"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Shot size"},{"text":"Camera angle"},{"text":"Camera movement"},{"text":"Framing"},{"text":"Composition"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Colour"},{"text":"Mise-en-scène"},{"text":"Montage"},{"text":"Continuity"},{"text":"Sound-image relationship"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"flow","items":["FILM","Story","Screenplay","Direction","Performance","Cinematography","Editing","Sound","Themes","Cultural Context","Critical Evaluation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Professional Film Criticism"},{"type":"p","text":"The final stage should focus on producing professional-quality criticism."},{"type":"h","text":"Students should learn to write:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Film reviews"},{"text":"Festival reviews"},{"text":"Director profiles"},{"text":"Actor profiles"},{"text":"Film essays"},{"text":"Retrospectives"},{"text":"Interviews"},{"text":"Cultural criticism"},{"text":"Industry analysis"},{"text":"Opinion columns"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional Review Structure"},{"type":"flow","items":["Hook","Film Context","Brief Premise","Direction","Screenplay","Performances","Visual Language","Editing & Sound","Themes","Strengths / Limitations","Overall Critical Judgment"]}]},{"heading":"Core Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill Area","Competencies"],"rows":[[{"text":"Film Studies"},{"text":"Film history, theory, genres"}],[{"text":"Journalism"},{"text":"Reporting, writing, editing"}],[{"text":"Critical Analysis"},{"text":"Interpretation and evaluation"}],[{"text":"Screen Analysis"},{"text":"Story, screenplay and structure"}],[{"text":"Visual Analysis"},{"text":"Cinematography and mise-en-scène"}],[{"text":"Performance Analysis"},{"text":"Acting and character construction"}],[{"text":"Editing Analysis"},{"text":"Rhythm, continuity, montage"}],[{"text":"Sound Analysis"},{"text":"Music, dialogue and sound design"}],[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Sources, interviews, contextual research"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Written and verbal communication"}],[{"text":"Digital Media"},{"text":"Video, podcast and social platforms"}],[{"text":"Ethics"},{"text":"Fairness, attribution and disclosure"}]]}]},{"heading":"Film Analysis Framework","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A professional critic should develop a repeatable framework."},{"type":"h","text":"1. Narrative"},{"type":"p","text":"Ask:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What is the central conflict?"},{"text":"Is the story coherent?"},{"text":"How are characters developed?"},{"text":"Does the structure support the theme?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Direction"},{"type":"p","text":"Evaluate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vision"},{"text":"Pacing"},{"text":"Performances"},{"text":"Visual storytelling"},{"text":"Tone"},{"text":"Scene construction"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Cinematography"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Composition"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Camera movement"},{"text":"Lens choices"},{"text":"Colour"},{"text":"Visual symbolism"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Editing"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pacing"},{"text":"Transitions"},{"text":"Montage"},{"text":"Continuity"},{"text":"Parallel editing"},{"text":"Rhythm"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Sound"},{"type":"p","text":"Consider:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Background score"},{"text":"Sound design"},{"text":"Dialogue"},{"text":"Silence"},{"text":"Ambient sound"},{"text":"Song placement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Themes"},{"type":"p","text":"Explore:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Social themes"},{"text":"Politics"},{"text":"Identity"},{"text":"Gender"},{"text":"Class"},{"text":"Culture"},{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"Family"},{"text":"Human relationships"}]}]},{"heading":"Film Criticism vs Film Review","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"These terms overlap, but there is an important distinction."},{"type":"h","text":"Film Review"},{"type":"p","text":"Usually answers:"},{"type":"p","text":"Should the audience watch this film?"},{"type":"p","text":"It is often shorter and more accessible."},{"type":"h","text":"Film Criticism"},{"type":"p","text":"Goes deeper:"},{"type":"p","text":"What does this film mean, how does it construct that meaning, and how does it relate to cinema, society and culture?"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong film critic should be capable of both."}]},{"heading":"Research Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Film criticism requires substantial research."},{"type":"p","text":"A critic may research:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Director's previous films"},{"text":"Screenwriter's work"},{"text":"Historical context"},{"text":"Genre conventions"},{"text":"Adaptation source"},{"text":"Production history"},{"text":"Cinematographer's style"},{"text":"Actor's filmography"},{"text":"Cultural references"},{"text":"Historical events represented in the film"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Film Viewing","Initial Notes","Scene Analysis","Background Research","Compare with Film History / Genre","Develop Argument","Write Draft","Fact Check","Edit","Publish"]}]},{"heading":"Building Film Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A serious film critic should develop broad cinema literacy."},{"type":"h","text":"Indian Cinema"},{"type":"p","text":"Explore:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hindi cinema"},{"text":"Telugu cinema"},{"text":"Tamil cinema"},{"text":"Malayalam cinema"},{"text":"Kannada cinema"},{"text":"Bengali cinema"},{"text":"Marathi cinema"},{"text":"Assamese cinema"},{"text":"Parallel/independent cinema"}]},{"type":"h","text":"International Cinema"},{"type":"p","text":"Explore:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hollywood"},{"text":"European cinema"},{"text":"Japanese cinema"},{"text":"Korean cinema"},{"text":"Iranian cinema"},{"text":"Latin American cinema"},{"text":"Chinese cinema"},{"text":"African cinema"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is not merely to watch many films but to understand different cinematic traditions and storytelling approaches."}]},{"heading":"Film Theory","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Students should gradually study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Auteur theory"},{"text":"Genre theory"},{"text":"Narrative theory"},{"text":"Feminist film theory"},{"text":"Marxist film criticism"},{"text":"Psychoanalytic film theory"},{"text":"Postcolonial film theory"},{"text":"Representation theory"},{"text":"Spectatorship"},{"text":"Semiotics"},{"text":"Documentary theory"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The student does not need to use complicated theory in every review. Theory should strengthen the argument rather than make the writing unnecessarily academic."}]},{"heading":"Writing Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A successful critic needs excellent writing."},{"type":"h","text":"Develop"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strong opening paragraphs"},{"text":"Clear arguments"},{"text":"Evidence-based analysis"},{"text":"Descriptive vocabulary"},{"text":"Concise writing"},{"text":"Logical structure"},{"text":"Original voice"},{"text":"Headline writing"},{"text":"SEO awareness"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Weak Review"},{"type":"p","text":"“The cinematography is amazing and the acting is good.”"},{"type":"h","text":"Stronger Critical Approach"},{"type":"p","text":"Explain:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What visual choices were made"},{"text":"How those choices affect the viewer"},{"text":"Which scenes demonstrate them"},{"text":"Whether the technique supports the narrative"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The goal is analysis rather than adjectives."}]},{"heading":"Ethical Film Criticism","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Professional critics should maintain credibility."},{"type":"h","text":"Important Principles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Avoid plagiarism"},{"text":"Attribute information"},{"text":"Distinguish fact from opinion"},{"text":"Disclose conflicts of interest"},{"text":"Avoid fabricated claims"},{"text":"Avoid personal attacks"},{"text":"Respect copyright"},{"text":"Do not reproduce copyrighted material unnecessarily"},{"text":"Clearly identify sponsored/promotional content"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Review Ethics"},{"type":"p","text":"If a critic receives:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Free screening access"},{"text":"Press invitation"},{"text":"Promotional material"},{"text":"Travel/hospitality"},{"text":"Industry benefits"}]},{"type":"p","text":"they should follow the publication's disclosure policy."}]},{"heading":"Spoiler Management","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Film critics need to communicate without unnecessarily ruining the viewing experience."},{"type":"h","text":"Basic Structure"},{"type":"flow","items":["No-Spoiler Introduction","Critical Analysis","Limited Plot Discussion","Spoiler Section — Clearly Marked"]},{"type":"p","text":"A critic should understand the publication's spoiler policy."}]},{"heading":"Digital Media Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Modern film critics should not rely only on newspapers."},{"type":"h","text":"Useful Platforms"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Personal website"},{"text":"YouTube"},{"text":"Instagram"},{"text":"LinkedIn"},{"text":"Podcasts"},{"text":"Newsletters"},{"text":"Digital magazines"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Content Formats"},{"type":"p","text":"900-word Review"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"60-second Video Review"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"10-minute YouTube Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Podcast Discussion"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Long-form Film Essay"},{"type":"p","text":"One film can therefore produce multiple content formats."}]},{"heading":"Video Review Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A modern critic can create video essays."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Camera basics"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Microphone usage"},{"text":"Scriptwriting"},{"text":"Voice-over"},{"text":"Editing"},{"text":"Thumbnail design"},{"text":"Subtitles"},{"text":"Visual storytelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Editing Tools"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Adobe Premiere Pro"},{"text":"DaVinci Resolve"},{"text":"Final Cut Pro"},{"text":"CapCut"},{"text":"Canva"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For professional work, learning DaVinci Resolve or Premiere Pro is particularly valuable."}]},{"heading":"Podcast Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Film criticism can also be delivered through audio."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microphone technique"},{"text":"Audio editing"},{"text":"Podcast scripting"},{"text":"Interviewing"},{"text":"Voice delivery"},{"text":"Show notes"},{"text":"Episode structuring"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful tools include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Audacity"},{"text":"Adobe Audition"},{"text":"Descript"},{"text":"Podcast hosting platforms"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended UG Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — 25-Film Critical Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Watch and critically analyze 25 films across:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Indian cinema"},{"text":"International cinema"},{"text":"Different genres"},{"text":"Different decades"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Maintain:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Film"},{"text":"Director"},{"text":"Genre"},{"text":"Key themes"},{"text":"Technical analysis"},{"text":"Critical evaluation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Director Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one filmmaker and analyze:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Film 1","Film 2","Film 3","Film 4","Film 5","Recurring Themes","Visual Style","Narrative Patterns","Auteur Profile"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Regional Cinema Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Compare films from two Indian industries."},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Telugu vs Malayalam"},{"text":"Hindi vs Tamil"},{"text":"Bengali vs Marathi"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Storytelling"},{"text":"Genre"},{"text":"Representation"},{"text":"Visual style"},{"text":"Industry context"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Film Review Website"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a personal film criticism website containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reviews"},{"text":"Essays"},{"text":"Director profiles"},{"text":"Festival coverage"},{"text":"Film recommendations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Video Essay"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a 8–15 minute video essay such as:"},{"type":"h","text":"“How Contemporary Indian Cinema Uses Silence as a Storytelling Device.”"},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Script"},{"text":"Voice-over"},{"text":"Visual analysis"},{"text":"Editing"},{"text":"References"}]}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Priority 1 — Film/Entertainment Publication"},{"type":"p","text":"Roles:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Film writer"},{"text":"Entertainment journalist"},{"text":"Editorial intern"},{"text":"Content researcher"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Priority 2 — Newspaper/Magazine"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Editorial standards"},{"text":"Feature writing"},{"text":"Copy editing"},{"text":"Reporting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Priority 3 — Digital Entertainment Platform"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"Digital publishing"},{"text":"Social media"},{"text":"Audience analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Priority 4 — Film Festival"},{"type":"p","text":"Gain exposure to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Film screenings"},{"text":"Director interactions"},{"text":"Q&A sessions"},{"text":"Festival programming"},{"text":"Film coverage"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Priority 5 — Production House"},{"type":"p","text":"Even if not working as a critic, production exposure helps understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Production"},{"text":"Direction"},{"text":"Editing"},{"text":"Cinematography"},{"text":"Distribution"}]}]},{"heading":"Portfolio Strategy","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For an aspiring film critic, the portfolio is extremely important."},{"type":"h","text":"Minimum Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"10 Short Reviews"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"5 Long-form Reviews"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"3 Film Essays"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"2 Director Studies"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"2 Video Essays"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"1 Festival Coverage"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"1 Interview"},{"type":"p","text":"A portfolio demonstrates actual critical ability far better than a list of certificates."}]},{"heading":"Employer Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Employer","Valuable Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Newspaper"},{"text":"Journalism + concise writing"}],[{"text":"Film Magazine"},{"text":"Film theory + long-form criticism"}],[{"text":"Digital Publication"},{"text":"SEO + fast writing + film knowledge"}],[{"text":"Entertainment Website"},{"text":"Reviews + digital content"}],[{"text":"Film Journal"},{"text":"Research + academic film studies"}],[{"text":"TV/News"},{"text":"On-camera communication"}],[{"text":"YouTube Channel"},{"text":"Scriptwriting + video production"}],[{"text":"Podcast"},{"text":"Analysis + communication"}],[{"text":"Film Festival"},{"text":"Film knowledge + reporting"}],[{"text":"Independent Media"},{"text":"Multi-platform content"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Additional Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"There is no single mandatory certification that makes someone a film critic."},{"type":"p","text":"More valuable areas include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Film"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Film appreciation"},{"text":"Film theory"},{"text":"Film history"},{"text":"Cinema studies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Journalism"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Feature writing"},{"text":"Digital journalism"},{"text":"Investigative research"},{"text":"Media ethics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"Video editing"},{"text":"Podcast production"},{"text":"Social media strategy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Academic"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research methodology"},{"text":"Cultural studies"},{"text":"Media studies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Practical output should be prioritized over certificate accumulation."}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Students can pursue:"},{"type":"h","text":"Film & Media"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.A. Film Studies"},{"text":"M.A. Cinema Studies"},{"text":"M.A. Mass Communication"},{"text":"M.A. Journalism"},{"text":"M.A. Media Studies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Related Areas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cultural Studies"},{"text":"English Literature"},{"text":"Comparative Literature"},{"text":"Communication Studies"},{"text":"Digital Media"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"flow","items":["BJMC / BA Journalism","MA Film Studies / Media Studies","Research","PhD","Film Scholar / Academic / Researcher"]}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A film critic can specialize in:"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Mainstream Cinema Criticism"},{"type":"p","text":"Reviews major commercial releases."},{"type":"h","text":"2. Independent Cinema"},{"type":"p","text":"Focuses on independent and alternative filmmaking."},{"type":"h","text":"3. Art-House Cinema"},{"type":"p","text":"Specializes in auteur and experimental cinema."},{"type":"h","text":"4. Regional Cinema"},{"type":"p","text":"Focuses on specific Indian-language industries."},{"type":"h","text":"5. International Cinema"},{"type":"p","text":"Covers global film movements and festivals."},{"type":"h","text":"6. Documentary Criticism"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyzes documentary filmmaking."},{"type":"h","text":"7. Film History"},{"type":"p","text":"Researches historical cinema."},{"type":"h","text":"8. Film & Culture"},{"type":"p","text":"Connects cinema with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Society"},{"text":"Politics"},{"text":"Gender"},{"text":"Identity"},{"text":"Culture"}]},{"type":"h","text":"9. Film Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyzes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"VFX"},{"text":"Virtual production"},{"text":"AI filmmaking"},{"text":"New camera technology"},{"text":"Digital cinema"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Film/Media Intern","Junior Film Writer","Film Reviewer","Film Critic","Senior Film Critic","Film/Culture Columnist","Film Editor / Culture Editor","Senior Media Professional"]},{"type":"p","text":"Alternative creator pathway:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Film Critic","YouTube / Podcast","Audience Building","Independent Film Brand","Creator / Media Entrepreneur"]}]},{"heading":"Emerging Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"AI-Assisted Research"},{"type":"p","text":"AI can help with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research organization"},{"text":"Comparing filmographies"},{"text":"Generating research questions"},{"text":"Transcription"},{"text":"Interview preparation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The critic must independently verify facts and develop the actual argument."},{"type":"h","text":"AI Video Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Computer vision may increasingly assist with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Shot detection"},{"text":"Scene segmentation"},{"text":"Colour analysis"},{"text":"Camera movement analysis"},{"text":"Editing patterns"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Generative AI"},{"type":"p","text":"Critics should understand how AI is changing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Screenwriting"},{"text":"VFX"},{"text":"Dubbing"},{"text":"Localization"},{"text":"Animation"},{"text":"Virtual production"},{"text":"Film marketing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This itself can become a new criticism specialization."}]},{"heading":"Film Criticism + Data","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A modern critic can combine qualitative criticism with audience and industry data."},{"type":"h","text":"Possible Data Points"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Box-office performance"},{"text":"Streaming rankings where reliable data is available"},{"text":"Audience demographics"},{"text":"Genre trends"},{"text":"Review sentiment"},{"text":"Festival selections"},{"text":"Awards data"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Film","Critical Analysis"]},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Audience Data"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Industry Data"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"flow","items":["Historical Context","Evidence-Based Film Commentary"]},{"type":"p","text":"Data should support criticism, not replace interpretation."}]},{"heading":"Target Profile at Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate should have:"},{"type":"h","text":"Film Knowledge"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Film history"},{"text":"Indian cinema"},{"text":"World cinema"},{"text":"Genres"},{"text":"Film theory"},{"text":"Contemporary cinema"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Critical Skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Narrative analysis"},{"text":"Direction analysis"},{"text":"Acting analysis"},{"text":"Cinematography"},{"text":"Editing"},{"text":"Sound"},{"text":"Cultural analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Journalism"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Review writing"},{"text":"Feature writing"},{"text":"Interviewing"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Fact checking"},{"text":"Editing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Website publishing"},{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"Video editing"},{"text":"Podcasting"},{"text":"Social media"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"At minimum:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"15+ published reviews"},{"text":"3–5 long-form essays"},{"text":"2 director studies"},{"text":"1 festival coverage project"},{"text":"2 video essays"},{"text":"1 interview"},{"text":"Personal film-criticism portfolio"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"FILM CRITIC"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"┌───────────────────┼───────────────────┐"},{"type":"p","text":"↓ ↓ ↓"},{"type":"p","text":"FILM STUDIES JOURNALISM CRITICISM"},{"type":"p","text":"│ │ │"},{"type":"p","text":"Film History Writing Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Film Theory Reporting Interpretation"},{"type":"p","text":"Genres Editing Evaluation"},{"type":"p","text":"Cinema Culture Research Argument"},{"type":"p","text":"│ │ │"},{"type":"flow","items":["└───────────────────┼───────────────────┘","FILM LANGUAGE"]},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"┌────────────────┼────────────────┐"},{"type":"p","text":"↓ ↓ ↓"},{"type":"p","text":"Cinematography Editing Sound"},{"type":"p","text":"│ │ │"},{"type":"flow","items":["└────────────────┼────────────────┘","DIGITAL MEDIA"]},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"┌──────────────┼──────────────┐"},{"type":"p","text":"↓ ↓ ↓"},{"type":"p","text":"Video Podcast SEO"},{"type":"p","text":"Essays Reviews Website"},{"type":"p","text":"│ │ │"},{"type":"flow","items":["└──────────────┼──────────────┘","AI ERA"]},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"Research + Analytics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Video Analysis + AI","MULTI-PLATFORM CRITIC"]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile is not simply:"},{"type":"h","text":"“Someone who watches movies and writes reviews.”"},{"type":"p","text":"Instead:"},{"type":"p","text":"“A research-driven film critic with strong journalism fundamentals, deep film-language knowledge, critical-writing ability, cultural awareness, digital publishing skills and multi-platform storytelling capability.”"},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal Career-Fitment Profile"},{"type":"note","label":"Foundation","text":"BJMC / B.A. Journalism & Mass Communication"},{"type":"flow","items":["Film history","theory","cinema studies"],"sep":"+","label":"Film"},{"type":"flow","items":["Narrative","direction","acting","cinematography","editing","sound"],"sep":"+","label":"Analysis"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research","reporting","interviewing","fact checking"],"sep":"+","label":"Journalism"},{"type":"flow","items":["Reviews","essays","features","cultural criticism"],"sep":"+","label":"Writing"},{"type":"flow","items":["Website","SEO","video","podcast","social media"],"sep":"+","label":"Digital"},{"type":"note","label":"Portfolio","text":"Consistent published criticism across multiple formats"},{"type":"flow","items":["AI filmmaking","VFX","virtual production","data-informed criticism"],"sep":"+","label":"Future-ready"},{"type":"flow","items":["Film Writer","Film Reviewer","Film Critic","Senior Critic","Film/Culture Editor or Independent Film-Media Creator"],"label":"Career progression"}]}]}